ok - untagged lock values: the session-pid helpers answer exactly as fm_pid_identity and fm_pid_alive do
ok - supervision host: a win:<pid> session lock yields the main-session key only while that Windows process lives
ok - auto-arm: a claim pins a win:<pid> lock holder and reads open only while that holder lives
